---
source: tests/callouts.rs
expression: "pinned_all(&[\"> [!NOTE]\\n> Useful information.\",\n\"> [!TIP]\\n> Helpful advice.\", \"> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> Key information.\",\n\"> [!WARNING]\\n> Urgent info, see `cargo publish`.\",\n\"> [!CAUTION]\\n> Risks of an action.\",], WIDTH, &default())"
---
"> [!NOTE]\n> Useful information."
[blue]┃ [][bold,blue]● Note[]
[blue]┃ []Useful information.
---
"> [!TIP]\n> Helpful advice."
[green]┃ [][bold,green]◆ Tip[]
[green]┃ []Helpful advice.
---
"> [!IMPORTANT]\n> Key information."
[magenta]┃ [][bold,magenta]■ Important[]
[magenta]┃ []Key information.
---
"> [!WARNING]\n> Urgent info, see `cargo publish`."
[yellow]┃ [][bold,yellow]▲ Warning[]
[yellow]┃ []Urgent info, see [yellow]cargo publish[].
---
"> [!CAUTION]\n> Risks of an action."
[red]┃ [][bold,red]✕ Caution[]
[red]┃ []Risks of an action.
